 341                 	; 101		-- A "real" TLS instruction (as the SBC6120 has) doesn't clear
 342                 	;		   the AC, the way a "fake" TLS (implemented by a 6101 PIE
 343                 	;		   WRITE) does.  This causes no end of problems for CONOUT and
 344                 	;		   everything that calls it!
